{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 1, "text": "嗨！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 2, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 3, "text": "对不起，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 4, "text": "差点就砸死你了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 5, "text": "哦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 6, "text": "我是说冰箱差点砸死你了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 7, "text": "跟我可没关系，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 8, "text": "我发誓！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 9, "text": "真的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 11, "text": "行，我信了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 13, "text": "说真的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 14, "text": "这里很危险…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 15, "text": "尤其是对你来说"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 17, "text": "// After a while 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 18, "text": "你不是个胆小鬼呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 19, "text": "观察你很有意思，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 20, "text": "看着你经历这一切"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 21, "text": "走过这些地方…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 22, "text": "快跑，快跑，宝贝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 23, "text": "我会追上你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 24, "text": "加油，加油！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 25, "text": "太有意思了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 27, "text": "// After a while 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 28, "text": "我看见你往电车那边去了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 29, "text": "那是各版本之间"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 30, "text": "最长的一条路…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 31, "text": "真好奇你将如何应对"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 32, "text": "那些生活在那里的存在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 33, "text": "如何穿越那片迷雾…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 35, "text": "// Panties"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 36, "text": "你在干什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 37, "text": "拜托…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 38, "text": "别看了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 39, "text": "傻瓜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 40, "text": "真是个傻瓜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 43, "text": "噢，好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 46, "text": "祝你好运！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 49, "text": "是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 50, "text": "我能感觉到你的存在…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 51, "text": "听我说"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 52, "text": "你是个玩家"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 53, "text": "对吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 54, "text": "帮我找找…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 55, "text": "找到一个…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 56, "text": "让我想想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 57, "text": "我不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 58, "text": "这到底是怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Cry 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 60, "text": "曾经我想忘记一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 61, "text": "我打碎了所有的镜子，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 62, "text": "我撕毁了所有的照片…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 63, "text": "但现在…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 64, "text": "我只觉得后悔"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 65, "text": "真是太愚蠢了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 66, "text": "每个人都会犯错，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 67, "text": "但是结果已经无法挽回的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 68, "text": "又该怎么办呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 69, "text": "我真希望这一切都没有发生过…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Cry 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 71, "text": "人们都说时间可以治愈一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 72, "text": "但时间是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 73, "text": "我再也不相信任何东西了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 74, "text": "如果时间可以治愈一切"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 75, "text": "至少带我走吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 76, "text": "带我离开这个世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 77, "text": "我恳求你，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 78, "text": "时间啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 79, "text": "快一点吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 80, "text": "快一点，彻底终结我吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Cry 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 82, "text": "她爱过…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 83, "text": "我是否也曾爱过？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 84, "text": "但我和她不一样。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 85, "text": "她的爱太过热烈，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 86, "text": "太过讨厌…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 87, "text": "太过炽热…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 88, "text": "太漫无节制…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 89, "text": "太让人嫉妒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 90, "text": "太令人愤怒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 91, "text": "太过疯狂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 92, "text": "// Cry 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 93, "text": "我记得，我时常被说情绪化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 94, "text": "你就是想太多了，米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 95, "text": "你会没事的，米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 96, "text": "你不是孤身一…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 97, "text": "但最后…又剩下什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 98, "text": "悲伤，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 99, "text": "绝望…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 100, "text": "还有恐惧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 101, "text": "// Cry 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 102, "text": "没有用的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 103, "text": "怎么都想不起来…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 104, "text": "我的手垂了下来…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 105, "text": "无尽的回声…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 106, "text": "我无法承受，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 107, "text": "自己被困在这里的念头…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 108, "text": "我一直都被困在这里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 109, "text": "为什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 110, "text": "我不记得了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 111, "text": "这一切会结束吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 112, "text": "我不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 114, "text": "// Mita get picture"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 115, "text": "这是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 116, "text": "一幅画…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 117, "text": "我想起来了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 118, "text": "谢谢你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 119, "text": "但是我的脸…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 120, "text": "我没有脸…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 121, "text": "全部都是因为她…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 122, "text": "她夺走了我的一部分…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 123, "text": "然后把它丢进虚空…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 124, "text": "她很强大…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 125, "text": "也很聪明。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 126, "text": "我无权阻拦你，玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 127, "text": "去看看衣柜吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 130, "text": "嘿！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 131, "text": "你挡住我的路了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 132, "text": "你就这么呆站着？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 133, "text": "你能让开吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 134, "text": "让我过去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 135, "text": "个头大就了不起吗！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 137, "text": "// HEY! STOP!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 138, "text": "你为什么要跟着我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 139, "text": "走开！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Funicular - radio voice"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 145, "text": "等等，玩家？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 146, "text": "你在这里做什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 148, "text": "那是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 150, "text": "又是玩家啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 151, "text": "我是米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 152, "text": "在这儿遥控电车。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 153, "text": "你知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 154, "text": "你现在正在走向死路吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 156, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 157, "text": "但我已经没有别的路可走了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 159, "text": "明白了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 160, "text": "按下按钮，到大炮后面去吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 162, "text": "大炮？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 164, "text": "嗯哼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 165, "text": "你以为扭扭方向盘就能过去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 166, "text": "还得通过这个击杀怪兽的小游戏呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 167, "text": "所以，准备射击吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 169, "text": "// Funicular go"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 170, "text": "好吧，我们要出发了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Funicular win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 172, "text": "太棒了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 173, "text": "你成功了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 174, "text": "// Funicular stop"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 175, "text": "快，离开这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 176, "text": "动作快！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 177, "text": "// Funicular wait 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 178, "text": "你站在那里干什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 179, "text": "我告诉过你，快离开。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Funicular wait 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 181, "text": "我不明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 182, "text": "你真的就只是站着？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 183, "text": "// Funicular tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 184, "text": "游戏机？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 185, "text": "拜托…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 186, "text": "// Funicular goodbye"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 187, "text": "再见。"}
